# Icons that play once over an Odd: a notebook when it keeps a lesson, a note
# when it uses one. Each grows in from a dot while rising, goes a pixel past
# where it rests, holds with a 1 px bob while the cover flicks or the pen ticks,
# then shrinks out. The Odd turns the frames in its own update, like its walk,
# so the floor's ambient clock never sees it.
sprite fx-pop
size 16 16
layer overlay
footprint 1 1
fps 8

frame notebook-0
